Let $m>2$ be a power of $2$, and let $c\in S(m)$.
Then $\GEM_2(\Phi_m(cx);1,m)$ omits the smallest prime $p\equiv1\pmod{m}$
if $(m,c)\notin\{(4,\pm2),(4,\pm3),(8,\pm2)\}$,
